"ds":"Drawn from Turley''s heritage vineyards across the state, this is Zinfandel at full throttle: brambly blackberry, boysenberry jam and kirsch, black pepper and cinnamon. Big, warm and plush, it keeps its balance through sheer density of old-vine fruit.","x":"284:6,285:52,286:52,287:90,288:85,289:88,290:72,291:35,292:0,293:12,12:85,3:60,18:50,14:55,28:60,27:45,120:50,124:30,135:40,126:35,111:20,156:25,167:20,153:20,213:45,226:65,229:65,227:30,241:90,244:80,238:65,237:60,257:55,255:70,278:90,260:35,279:70,283:60,300:100,302:100,308:100,296:100,309:100"},{"s":"duckhorn-vineyards-sauvignon-blanc","n":"Sauvignon Blanc","p":"Duckhorn Vineyards","t":"white","c":"USA","r":"North Coast","a":"North Coast","g":["Sauvignon Blanc","Sémillon"],"pr":30,"abv":13.5,"e":"Mostly stainless steel, with a portion fermented in French oak","sv":"8–10°C","d":"Not needed","w":"Now–2 years","ds":"A polished, fruit-led California Sauvignon: pink grapefruit, honeydew and passion fruit with a lemongrass edge. A splash of Sémillon and a little barrel work round the palate without dulling its crisp, refreshing finish.","x":"284:4,285:72,286:2,287:60,288:52,289:70,290:60,291:15,292:0,293:10,36:75,34:50,35:40,60:45,68:50,65:35,49:30,53:35,66:30,110:30,89:30,85:25,136:20,177:15,228:65,229:55,224:30,240:80,244:60,256:80,247:50,261:45,260:20,279:85,283:85,303:100,305:100,318:100,313:100,307:100"},{"s":"schramsberg-blanc-de-blancs","n":"Blanc de Blancs Brut","p":"Schramsberg Vineyards","t":"sparkling","c":"USA","r":"North Coast","a":"North Coast","g":["Chardonnay"],"pr":42,"abv":12.5,"e":"Traditional method; a small portion barrel-fermented; about 2 years on the lees","sv":"6–8°C","d":"Not needed","w":"Now–6 years","ds":"America''s pioneering traditional-method Blanc de Blancs: green apple, lemon and pear threaded with brioche and toasted almond. The mousse is fine and persistent, and bright acidity gives it a chalky, focused finish.","x":"284:8,285:82,286:0,287:45,288:45,289:65,290:70,291:5,292:95,293:20,46:65,34:70,40:40,49:45,53:20,36:20,178:50,184:40,180:35,181:35,202:25,203:15,138:30,136:35,85:25,233:80,228:75,230:50,236:70,240:85,249:65,258:65,272:95,279:60,283:60,306:100,305:100,319:100,323:100,307:100"},{"s":"roederer-estate-brut","n":"Brut","p":"Roederer Estate","t":"sparkling","c":"USA","r":"Mendocino County","a":"Anderson Valley","g":["Chardonnay","Pinot Noir"],"pr":29,"abv":12,"e":"Traditional method with oak-aged reserve wines in the blend; about 2 years on the lees","sv":"6–8°C","d":"Not needed","w":"Now–4 years","ds":"Champagne pedigree transplanted to the cool Anderson Valley: ripe pear and yellow apple with brioche, hazelnut and a creamy, generous mousse. Oak-aged reserve wines add depth well beyond its price, while fog-cooled acidity keeps it lively.","x":"284:10,285:75,286:2,287:45,288:52,289:62,290:65,291:12,292:95,293:20,49:60,47:55,46:35,48:20,34:50,53:25,178:50,180:40,184:30,203:30,181:30,202:20,177:25,138:15,233:70,221:50,224:40,228:55,236:60,240:75,250:50,258:65,256:70,272:95,283:75,323:100,319:100,306:100,305:100,307:100"},{"s":"broc-cellars-love-red","n":"Love Red","p":"Broc Cellars","t":"red","c":"USA","r":"California","a":"North Coast","g":["Carignan","Syrah","Valdiguié"],"pr":24,"abv":12,"e":"Native-yeast fermentation with some whole clusters; short ageing in steel and concrete; minimal sulfur","sv":"12–14°C","d":"Not needed","w":"Now–2 years","ds":"Berkeley natural-wine glou-glou in its purest form: crunchy raspberry, cherry and pomegranate with a dash of pepper and a faintly wild, earthy edge. Light, juicy and meant to be served with a slight chill and finished the same night.","x":"284:2,285:70,286:30,287:45,288:38,289:60,290:45,291:0,292:3,293:5,3:70,1:60,8:35,7:30,4:30,12:30,9:30,120:30,71:20,111:20,151:20,155:10,229:85,228:45,235:10,256:95,240:90,253:45,244:60,265:95,263:40,262:25,261:60,283:100,279:90,311:100,301:100,302:100,309:100,319:100"},{"s":"domaine-drouhin-oregon-dundee-hills-pinot-noir","n":"Dundee Hills Pinot Noi